# ============================================================
# SAFETY NET — never ignore source code
# ============================================================
!**/src/
!**/src/**
!packages/*/src/
!packages/*/src/**

# Re-exclude build artifacts that the src/ safety net above would pull back in
**/src/**/__pycache__/
**/src/**/*.pyc
